%% Designed/deployed workflow from the technical paper.
%% The public repo contains the source snapshot for parts of this flow.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Sheet as Google Sheets
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant UI as PySide UI
    participant DCC as Maya/Blender Adapter
    participant Deadline as Deadline
    participant Worker as Worker PCs
    participant NAS as NAS Storage

    User->>Sheet: Reserve render slot
    Sheet->>Mongo: Sync reservation data
    User->>UI: Log in during reserved slot
    UI->>Mongo: Validate user and reservation
    UI->>DCC: Gather scene and render settings
    DCC->>UI: Return job metadata
    UI->>Deadline: Submit job with deadlinecommand
    Deadline->>Worker: Assign frame tasks
    Worker->>NAS: Read scene/assets and write output
    User->>Deadline: Monitor job/task status
